"site.lc.ifThisDoesntProvide": "If this doesnt provide any help, the following applies: Dont trust that player – dont attack that player. In spite of all these rules and advices there will always be some unsightly incidents.",
"site.lc.makeItClearTo": "Make it clear to yourself that eating back shouldnt be the first choice to solve the problem - it only strengthens it. So if you have been eaten by an ℄ proceed as follows:",
"site.lc.askForTheOne": "Ask for the one in the clan chat and talk to him directly and in a POLITE way for the reason of his attack",
"site.lc.mostlySomethingLikeThat": "Mostly something like that happen by mistake and the other can explain it or apologize for it and possibly also return the mass.",
"site.lc.ifThisDoesntHelp": "If this doesnt help and you get into dispute, add an admin (preferably Hany El Gohary or Contra as our disputers)",
"site.lc.bloodIsThickerThan": "Blood is thicker than water - so Clan goes first!",
"site.lc.thisMeansAcceptNo": "This means ℄ accept NO random friends. Random friends are all those who are not ℄.",
"site.lc.itIsPrettyClear": "It is pretty clear, that everyone have friends outside of the clan and this is ok. But dont expect that you can put your friends under protection.",
"site.lc.ifYouJoinA": "If you join a ℄ server of if ℄ join a server where you are just playing, get ready to eat everything. If you have a problem by get eaten by someone at least dont give him w and do not start to team with him!",
"site.lc.onAServerMass": "On a ℄-Server mass belongs to ℄. If you are afraid to lose your friends outside the clan, think about a new name only for playing with ℄. This way you can avoid problems with both, the clan and your old friends.",
"site.lc.respectIsMutualNot": "Respect is mutual, not just one-sided. You dont want to be insulted, threatened, blamed, etc…. - so do not insult, threaten and blame anybody else!!!! A polite attitude even if you are angry is a MUST.",
"site.lc.likeInAFamily": "Like in a family you should know WHO is “daddy” and WHO is “mommy”. So get informed!!! All these informations you will find on our continuously updated website",
"site.lc.weAreAndWe": "We are ℄! And we have our own mod! And if you haven't used it already, you should familiarize yourself with the idea of getting used to our mod.",
"site.lc.factIsEspeciallyOn": "Fact is, especially on a war server a common tool is essential. And if you think at first it is strange and you won't get used to it never ever – You WILL get used to it if you just use it continously.",
"site.lc.theModYouCan": "The mod you can get here:",
"site.lc.ifYouStillHave": "If you still have questions or you need help - feel free to ask and get help.",
