"site.lc.bannedPlayersEnemiesAnd": "Banned Players (Enemies and can never join clan):",
"site.lc.weHaveABan": "We have a ban list for some players. They cannot join our clan",
"site.lc.muchHappened": "Much happened",
"site.lc.ourRootsCameFrom2": "Our roots came from the remnants of PZA AGAR, FUN, CRAZINESS, FRIENDSHIP Skype group. We were all friends and solo players teaming with each other..",
"site.lc.someOfTheMore": "Some of the more experienced players slowly began joining a clan named EU. In that clan, members were forced to eat previous friends from the PZA Skype group.",
"site.lc.aClanThatHad": "A clan that had previously lead two Skype groups to desertion as some entered into clan and those that did not qualify were left on their own.",
"site.lc.theseRemnantPlayersDecided": "These remnant players decided to strike back….",
"site.lc.canWeHaveA2": "can we have a special symbol in front of our name to show that we are a team?",
"site.lc.anySymbol": "any symbol",
"site.lc.aCharacter": "a character",
"site.lc.iamlegendNovember11th2016": "❶♔IamLegend, November 11th 2016",
"site.lc.november12th2016We": "November, 12th 2016, we used ♋ symbol for the first time, and were named Clan 69.",
"site.lc.strikeWasImmediateBy": "Strike was immediate by Clan EU. We made peace after a while, but it did not last for long. Thus began our venture.",
"site.lc.one262711": "One 26-27/11/2016 we made elections for Clan name and symbol,we were named ❶LEGEND Clan after. Situations made players of Clan very experienced.",
"site.lc.oldAndNewMembers": "Old and new members reformed an elite FFA clan that proved to destroy any clan due to tools and experience of their great players.",
"site.lc.weAreClanWe": "We are ℄ Clan. We are made up of Elite Members and Recruits and we consider ourselves united as much as a family would. We also have room for strong friendships and diverse unions.",
"site.lc.weMainlyInvadeServers": "We mainly invade servers dominated by other clans and we destroy them. We play in Europe, Russia, Turkey and other various servers...",
"site.lc.bothEliteAndRecruited": "Both Elite and Recruited players remain united as a clan in any battle and their combined efforts win wars.",
"site.lc.thisMayMeanSupporting": "This may mean supporting the clan family more than other random friends.We offer all our Clan members stability, unity, strategy, support and respect.",
"site.lc.forAnyWhoDecide": "For any who decide our Clan does not suit them, they are free to leave; with the understanding that they may fall under the category of an enemy or betrayer.",
"site.lc.clanDoesNotHave": "℄ Clan does not have friends, only allies which it fully respects.As an Elite Clan, all Members and Recruits must exercise awareness, understanding,",
"site.lc.patienceWithOneAnd": "patience with one and other, but mostly respect for both Clan and Symbol worn in their names. All Members are expected to act respectably",
"site.lc.inAllChatRooms": "in all chat rooms/in all forms of social media and not taint the image of ℄ Clan.",
"site.lc.ourGoalIsTo": "Our goal is to grow this Elite Clan on all modes of Agario. To play against respectable enemies with respectable means but beat others with their",
"site.lc.ownTricksUntilRespect": "own tricks until respect and fairness can rule again.",
